        <h1>Dogecoin Mnemonic Converter</h1>

        <p>
            Convert a Dogecoin <abbr title="Hierarchical Deterministic">HD</abbr> wallet
            <strong>mnemonic</strong> into private keys. A mnemonic is also known as a <strong>seed phrase</strong>,
            backup phrase, or recovery phrase and usually contains 12 words.
        </p>

        <ul class="nav nav-tabs">
